  "raw_text": "PLAN \"12-Week Strength + Hypertrophy Program\"\nTYPE workout\nVISIBILITY public\n\nGOALS\n  GOAL primary strength:\n    name \"Increase overall strength and lean body mass with progressive overload over 12 weeks\"\n\nPHASES\n  PHASE \"Phase 1\" (4 weeks):\n    WEEK 1:\n      DAY Monday training 45m \"Full Body Strength Foundation I\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          squat 3x5 rpe 8 rest 180 seconds\n          bench_press 3x5 rpe 8 rest 180 seconds\n          barbell_row 3x5 rpe 8 rest 180 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          shoulder_stretch  not applicable\n    WEEK 1:\n      DAY Wednesday training 45m \"Hypertrophy Volume I\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          goblet_squat 3x10 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          incline_press 3x10 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          dumbbell_row 3x10 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          chest_stretch 15 minutes\n    WEEK 1:\n      DAY Friday training 45m \"Posterior Chain & Accessory I\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          deadlift 2x5 rpe 8 rest 180 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 3x10 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          face_pull 3x12 rpe 7 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          hamstring_stretch 60 seconds\n  PHASE \"Phase 1\" (4 weeks) continues:\n    WEEK 2:\n      DAY Monday training 45m \"Full Body Strength Foundation II\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          squat 3x5 rpe 8 rest 180 seconds\n          bench_press 3x5 rpe 8 rest 180 seconds\n          barbell_row 3x5 rpe 8 rest 180 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          hip_flexor_stretch 60 seconds\n    WEEK 2:\n      DAY Wednesday training 45m \"Hypertrophy Volume II\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          goblet_squat 3x10 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          incline_press 3x10 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          dumbbell_row 3x10 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          lat_stretch 60 seconds\n    WEEK 2:\n      DAY Friday training 45m \"Posterior Chain & Accessory II\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          deadlift 2x5 rpe 8 rest 180 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 3x10 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          face_pull 3x12 rpe 7 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          child_pose 60 seconds\n\n  PHASE \"Phase 2\" (4 weeks):\n    WEEK 3:\n      DAY Monday training 50m \"Strength Progression I\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          squat 4x4 rpe 8 rest 210 seconds\n          bench_press 4x4 rpe 8 rest 210 seconds\n          barbell_row 4x4 rpe 8 rest 210 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          light_quad_stretch 60 seconds\n    WEEK 3:\n      DAY Wednesday training 50m \"Hypertrophy Focus I\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          goblet_squat 4x8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          incline_press 4x8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          dumbbell_row 4x8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          scapular_retraction 60 seconds\n    WEEK 3:\n      DAY Friday training 50m \"Accessory & Posterior Chain I\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          deadlift 3x5 rpe 8 rest 180 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 3x8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          face_pull 3x12 rpe 7 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          lower_back_stretch 60 seconds\n    WEEK 4:\n      DAY Monday training 50m \"Strength Progression II\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          squat 4x4 rpe 8 rest 210 seconds\n          bench_press 4x4 rpe 8 rest 210 seconds\n          barbell_row 4x4 rpe 8 rest 210 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          quad_stretch 60 seconds\n    WEEK 4:\n      DAY Wednesday training 50m \"Hypertrophy Focus II\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          goblet_squat 4x8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          incline_press 4x8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          dumbbell_row 4x8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          lat_diamond_stretch 60 seconds\n    WEEK 4:\n      DAY Friday training 50m \"Accessory & Posterior Chain II\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          deadlift 3x5 rpe 8 rest 180 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 3x8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          face_pull 3x12 rpe 7 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          hamstring_stretch 60 seconds\n\n  PHASE \"Phase 3\" (4 weeks):\n    WEEK 5:\n      DAY Monday training 55m \"Strength Peak I\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          squat 5x3 rpe 8 rest 210 seconds\n          bench_press 5x3 rpe 8 rest 210 seconds\n          barbell_row 5x3 rpe 8 rest 210 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          hip_flexor_stretch 60 seconds\n    WEEK 5:\n      DAY Wednesday training 55m \"Hypertrophy Peak I\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          goblet_squat 4x8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          incline_press 4x8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          dumbbell_row 4x8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          shoulder_stretch 60 seconds\n    WEEK 5:\n      DAY Friday training 55m \"Accessory Focus I\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          deadlift 3x5 rpe 8 rest 180 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 3x8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          face_pull 3x12 rpe 7 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          lower_back_stretch 60 seconds\n    WEEK 6:\n      DAY Monday training 55m \"Strength Peak II\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          squat 5x3 rpe 8 rest 210 seconds\n          bench_press 5x3 rpe 8 rest 210 seconds\n          barbell_row 5x3 rpe 8 rest 210 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          quad_stretch 60 seconds\n    WEEK 6:\n      DAY Wednesday training 55m \"Hypertrophy Peak II\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          goblet_squat 4x8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          incline_press 4x8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          dumbbell_row 4x8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          lat_stretch 60 seconds\n    WEEK 6:\n      DAY Friday training 55m \"Accessory Focus II\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          deadlift 3x5 rpe 8 rest 180 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 3x8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          face_pull 3x12 rpe 7 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          hamstring_stretch 60 seconds\n\n  PHASE \"Phase 4\" (4 weeks):\n    WEEK 7:\n      DAY Monday training 60m \"Strength Consolidation I\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          squat 5x4 rpe 8 rest 210 seconds\n          bench_press 5x4 rpe 8 rest 210 seconds\n          barbell_row 5x4 rpe 8 rest 210 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          hip_flexor_stretch 60 seconds\n    WEEK 7:\n      DAY Wednesday training 60m \"Hypertrophy Consolidation I\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          goblet_squat 4x8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          incline_press 4x8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          dumbbell_row 4x8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          shoulder_stretch 60 seconds\n    WEEK 7:\n      DAY Friday training 60m \"Accessory Consolidation I\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          deadlift 4x5 rpe 8 rest 180 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 4x8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          face_pull 3x12 rpe 7 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          lower_back_stretch 60 seconds\n    WEEK 8:\n      DAY Monday training 60m \"Strength Consolidation II\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          squat 5x4 rpe 8 rest 210 seconds\n          bench_press 5x4 rpe 8 rest 210 seconds\n          barbell_row 5x4 rpe 8 rest 210 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          quad_stretch 60 seconds\n    WEEK 8:\n      DAY Wednesday training 60m \"Hypertrophy Consolidation II\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          goblet_squat 4x8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          incline_press 4x8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          dumbbell_row 4x8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          lat_stretch 60 seconds\n    WEEK 8:\n      DAY Friday training 60m \"Accessory Consolidation II\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          deadlift 4x5 rpe 8 rest 180 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 4x8 rpe 7 rest 90 seconds\n          face_pull 3x12 rpe 7 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          hamstring_stretch 60 seconds\n\nnotes:\n  - Ensure progressive overload by increasing either load or reps every 1-2 weeks within each phase, while maintaining proper form.\n  - Adjust RPE targets if needed based on recovery and performance.\n  - Include 7–9 hours of sleep, protein intake around 1.6–2.2 g/kg/day, and overall caloric intake aligned with body recomposition goals.",
